{"availability":"available","full":"pazare/Claude-CMU-Hackathon","name":"Claude-CMU-Hackathon","description":"Claude-built hackathon prototype that unifies CMU event discovery across schools into one personalized feed. Live demo on Pages.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-15T18:44:20Z","updated":"2026-07-09T22:40:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pazare.github.io/Claude-CMU-Hackathon/","topics":["claude","cmu","event-discovery","hackathon","nextjs","typescript"],"demo":"https://pazare.github.io/Claude-CMU-Hackathon/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:48:24.001Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:48:24.001Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:48:24.001Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:40:55.198Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:48:24.001Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Photo of a poster wall → Claude vision extracts structured listings → ranked swipe deck → your saved mural.","Next.js 14 (App Router), React 18, TypeScript in strict mode, and Tailwind CSS, shipped as a static export with no backend; extraction is a client-side call to the Claude Messages API with a JSON-schema structured output, and the swipe deck is ordered by a deterministic in-browser ranker that scores each flyer on token matches between your chosen interests and its title, summary, and tags.","Photograph a crowded poster wall at CMU. Claude reads every flyer on it (events, research studies, jobs, tutoring, things for sale, club sign-ups), and you swipe through them to build your own mural: a board of the posters that matter to you."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pazare/Claude-CMU-Hackathon/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"872be385215868b6f96a33083c2335a6c1f90a0889e9394d09bdf5f4d6bb2a76","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:55.353Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:55.353Z","projectInsights":{"ver